# =============================================================================
# Root .gitignore — besu-octopus-ghactions-tf-aws
#
# This monorepo holds three formerly separate projects:
#   sbsa_besu/     the platform itself
#   mimic_vpc/     the cloud team's landing-zone VPC, as a consumer sees it
#   mimic_egress/  the cloud team's shared egress proxy, as a consumer sees it
#
# Each keeps its own .gitignore, which still governs its own subtree. The rules
# here are the floor that applies everywhere, so a new subdirectory cannot
# silently start committing state, secrets, or provider binaries.
# =============================================================================

# --- Terraform working dirs & state (NEVER commit) ---------------------------
# State can contain plaintext secrets (CA private key, generated passwords);
# .terraform/ holds large machine-specific provider binaries (~4 GB here).
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfstate.backup
crash.log
crash.*.log

# --- Plan files --------------------------------------------------------------
# A saved plan embeds the resolved variable values and the resource attributes
# read from state, so it is as sensitive as state itself — and it is a build
# artifact, regenerated by every `terraform plan`.
*.plan
*.tfplan
*.tfplan.*

# --- Secrets in tfvars -------------------------------------------------------
# Real tfvars are never committed; the *.tfvars.example templates ARE committed,
# and `*.tfvars.example` is not matched by `*.tfvars`, so they stay tracked.
#
# ENVIRONMENT-NAME-AGNOSTIC ON PURPOSE: enumerating environments (prod, dev...)
# is how the 2026-09-09 dev -> sit rename silently un-ignored the real tfvars.
**/environments/*/*.tfvars
*secrets*.tfvars

# Generated hand-over files passed between the three projects, never committed.
*.auto.tfvars
network-handover.auto.tfvars
egress-handover.auto.tfvars

# --- Local tooling & credentials ---------------------------------------------
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
mywallet.wallet
.DS_Store

# Machine-local Claude Code settings (.claude/settings.json stays tracked).
.claude/settings.local.json
